data
# Local development configuration is not part of shipped image builds.
.worktrees
dev
docker
docs
.git
.github
# Build output and local state. The image builds make their own.
**/.cache
**/.nitro
**/.output
**/.tanstack
**/coverage
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Local environment files can hold secrets and change what Vite builds.
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Rust build output. Sending a crate's target/ into the build context would be
# gigabytes and would invalidate the context on every local cargo run; the
# images build both crates from source in their own stages.
**/target
